<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div><div style="text-align: left;"><font face="arial">Great talking with you today, I know you have no current need for capital but things can pop up unexpectedly and we have money available for you. Please make sure to reach out to me directly when that need does occur.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="text-align: right; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">When you are ready, please send me the following:&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Last 3 months of business bank statements (all pages)&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Most recent business tax return (2013/2014, top page)&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Signed and completed application</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Sincerely,</span><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!User.Name}</span><br><b>National Funding</b><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!User.Title}</span><br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=HotProspect">www.nationalfunding.com</a><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}</span><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Email: {!User.Email}</span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>